  "caveats": [
    "Prices come from objective scenarios ONLY. The ruleset wins on objectives and never on kills, so an average including Annihilate prices a game nobody plays.",
    "Annihilate is reported per cell because it diagnoses what an atom does; it is never summed into a price.",
    "A sign-split verdict means the average was hiding opposite behaviour, not that the effect is strong. The objective-only figure still has to clear significance on its own before it becomes a price."
